The '''Leeches Lair''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Black Lagoon}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Features ==
The '''Leeches Lair''' features a few attractions.

=== Leech Supreme ===
{{Main|Leech Supreme}}
The {{MobSprite|Leech Supreme}} is a boss found in the '''Leeches Lair'''. They spawn a few seconds after they were last killed. The [[Leech Supreme]] will cast several different attacks, one at a time, in order to kill the player. Once the player successfully kills the Leech, they will receive {{Item|Leech Supreme Fragment}}s and {{Motes}}.

=== Water ===
Surrounding the platform in the center of the '''Leeches Lair''' is a pool of water. Entering the water removes {{stat|rt|1}} every second. After a few seconds, the player will be flung out and onto the platform, but if this is unsuccessful, then they will be tried to be flung out again, until they land on the platform. Additionally, there are ladders that the player can climb up to escape from the water.

